  "Label Variable Description": "The status of categorical variables (product number, station number, etc.) is displayed in light blue labels at the top of the graph. The change in label is the point of change (product number change, etc.). You can select variables whose data type (Type) is category (Cat), string (Str), or serial (Seri).",
