  "There is no datetime column. If there is no datetime column, the application generates a dummy data for datetime.": "There is no datetime column. If there is no datetime column, the application generates a dummy data for datetime.",
  "Since there is no datetime column, the application generates a dummy data for datetime.": "Since there is no datetime variable, the application will generate a dummy data for datetime.",
  "K sep type notification": "The data type of a real or integer variable that includes a thousands separator may be presumed to a different type such as string(Str), so check the presumed data type.",
  "Preview same value message": "There are variables with only the same values in the previewed data. Please check whether it is set as the variable to import data.",
  "Preview null value message": "There are variables in the previewed data that do not have any values. If you want to set the variable to import data, please check and specify the appropriate data type.",
  "Dummy Datetime Generate On DS Confirm Message": "The target file does not have a datetime variable.\nThe system requires datetime, so are you sure to generate dummy datetime(DatetimeDummy) and continue setting?\n\nDummy datetime is generated as follows.\n<ul><li>Generate initial datetime on the first record of the target file which is 00:00 on the 1st day of this month.</li><li>Recursively add 10 seconds by records.</li><li>For the next file, initialize by 00:00 on the next day of latest datetime, and recursively add 10 seconds by records.</li></ul>",
  "Dummy Datetime Generate On Proc Confirm Message": "Dummy datetime (DatetimeDummy) was generated because there is no datetime variable in the target file.\n\nPlease check the generated dummy datetime and import it with As Datetime checked.\n\nDummy datetime is generated as follows.<ul><li>Generate initial datetime on the first record of the target file which is 00:00 on the 1st day of this month.</li><li>Recursively add 10 seconds by records.</li><li>For the next file, initialize by 00:00 on the next day of latest datetime, and recursively add 10 seconds by records.</li></ul>",
  "Anchor cursor": "Anchor cursor(Click)",
  "Show  cursor from all labels": "Show  cursor from all labels(Double click)",
  "Hide cursor": "Hide cursor(Click/Double click)",
  "The target file does not have a datetime column. Please prepare a datetime column or consider using dummy datetime (DatetimeDummy).": "There is no datetime variable. If there is no datetime variable, the application generates a dummy data for datetime.",
  "MSP Hide Contour MSG": "Since the number of data points drawn on one graph is large, a high-speed mode scatter plot with contour is drawn.If you want to plot all data points, please change the target period to reduce the number of data points.",
  "InfCastValue": "±Inf and their estimated values are displayed on the graph as NA.",
  "Values those have pulsed number of occurrences compared to the neighbors: Replace to NA": "Pulsed: When drawing a distribution, a value that suddenly has a large number of data relative to the surrounding area (pulse-like distribution exists) => Replaced with NA",
  "Cleansing": "Cleansing",
