  "Dup check message": "Calculate duplicate counts of the variable which selected as the 'As Link ID'.\nAuto: calculate when the number of data points is 12,000 or less.\nCheck: Always activate the calculation.\nSkip: Always do not activate the calculation.\nCalculated duplicate counts is shown on the bottom left corner of the page after clicking the 'Display graph' button.\nThis calculation may take time on large amount of data.",
