  "Daterange divide by calender hover msg": "Aggregate for each division selected in 'Divide format' based on the start time set in Date range.\nFor example, in the case of daily aggregation, aggregation is performed every 24 hours from the start time.",
  "Offset hover msg": "Stagger the switching time of working days. (-24 to 24)\nExample: 7.5 in increments of 1 day, from 7:30 to 31:30 (7:30 the next morning)",
