  "SkD hover strengthen selection": "Automatically removes more variables that have small effect on the objective.\nThis is effective when a large number of variables are selected.\nNote that categorical variables such as Machine and PartNo are likely to be removed.\nIf variables that has originally high coefficient are removed,\nthey may have a strong correlation with the selected variables.",
  "GL target variable": "Partial correlation structure between the selected variables here is visualized.\nPartial correlation differs from generally used correlation, in a sense that it \nremoves confounding (pseudo-correlation) using the selected variables.\nIgnorably small partial correlations are automatically excluded in the visualization\nYou can select up to 60 variables.",
  "GL objective hover messenger": "(optional) The variable selected here is called 'Objective variable (variable that you want to clarify the factors)', \nwhich we will adjust the visualization to get a more easy to understand layout.",
